    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Our San Francisco Drug & Alcohol Addiction Treatment Services"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "A medically-assisted detoxification allows the benefit of medical oversight and intervention for managing the withdrawal symptoms that will emerge during the detox process. At Marina Harbor Detox, our luxury drug detox facility in the Bay provides a number of services that include:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We offer a comprehensive and luxury alcohol detox to kickstart the recovery process and find the path to healing."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our services include a medically-supervised drug detox to ensure the safety and comfort through this process."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Residential inpatient treatment provides 24/7 addiction and mental health care in a structured environment focused on long-term recovery."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Holistic Therapy"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our services include a medically-supervised drug detox to ensure the safety and comfort through this process."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Private rooms + More"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We offer 6 private rooms, with breathtaking views of the San Francisco Bay, and all the amenities of a 5-star hotel."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "24/7 Help for Addiction"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Marina Harbor Detox is here to help you find the best treatment options that meet you personal needs, day or night."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "They Trusted Marina Harbor Detox"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Your Path to Lasting Recovery Begins at Marina Harbor Detox"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Marina Harbor has a dedicated team of trained professionals who work one-on-one with our clients, making sure they receive the best care that is catered to their individual needs. Every resident will meet with our program director before discharge to ensure that they are informed of all local aftercare services that will help in maintaining lasting sobriety. These services include: residential treatment, intensive outpatient treatment, sober living environments, AA and other 12-step meetings, etc. Our minimum stay is 7 days, with the average resident staying for 30-45 days.​"
    }
  ],
